  "solution": "**Given:- ** \n\n[84 - (-8) × {16 - (11 - 3)} + {5 + (-8) × (-4)}]\n\n**Concept used:**- \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation:-**\n\n⇒ [84 - (-8) × {16 - (11 - 3)} + {5 + (-8) × (-4)}] \n\n⇒ [84 - (-8) × {16 - 8} + {5 + (-8) × (-4)}]\n\n⇒ [84 - (-8) × 8 + {5 + 32}] \n\n⇒ [84 + 64 + 37]\n\n⇒[185]\n\n**∴The value of the expression is __185__. **",
